      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         SCHOOL LANE                                              south side 5/336                                        No.26                                              II House, formerly two cottages. C17 altered. Timber framed with painted plaster and brick infill, LH bay brick faced. Half hipped thatched roof, brick chimney in LH bay, 2 eaves dormers in thatch, the LH one gabled. 1-storey and attic, 3 bays, of 3-light wood casements, door with small hood in LH bay. 1-storey weatherboarded and tiled outbuilding attached on LH. RCHM I.p.317. MON.31. Listing NGR: SP8558710493"
    }
